"start": 149.70000000000002, "end": 151.34, "text": " And as was his custom,", "tokens": [50608, 400, 382, 390, 702, 2375, 11, 50690], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19699249267578126, "compression_ratio": 1.7432950191570882, "no_speech_prob": 0.0027104371692985296}, {"id": 41, "seek": 14484, "start": 151.74, "end": 154.06, "text": " he went to the synagogue on the Sabbath day,", "tokens": [50710, 415, 1437, 281, 264, 49169, 322, 264, 36618, 786, 11, 50826], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19699249267578126, "compression_ratio": 1.7432950191570882, "no_speech_prob": 0.0027104371692985296}, {"id": 42, "seek": 14484, "start": 154.32, "end": 155.72, "text": " and he stood up to read.", "tokens": [50839, 293, 415, 9371, 493, 281, 1401, 13, 50909], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19699249267578126, "compression_ratio": 1.7432950191570882, "no_speech_prob": 0.0027104371692985296}, {"id": 43, "seek": 14484, "start": 156.42000000000002, "end": 159.46, "text": " And the scroll of the prophet Isaiah was given to him.", "tokens": [50944, 400, 264, 11369, 295, 264, 18566, 27263, 390, 2212, 281, 796, 13, 51096], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19699249267578126, "compression_ratio": 1.7432950191570882, "no_speech_prob": 0.0027104371692985296}, {"id": 44, "seek": 14484, "start": 159.76, "end": 161.3, "text": " He unrolled the scroll,", "tokens": [51111, 634, 517, 28850, 264, 11369, 11, 51188], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19699249267578126, "compression_ratio": 1.7432950191570882, "no_speech_prob": 0.0027104371692985296}, {"id": 45, "seek": 14484, "start": 161.76, "end": 163.3, "text": " and found the place where it was written,", "tokens": [51211, 293, 1352, 264, 1081, 689, 309, 390, 3720, 11, 51288], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19699249267578126, "compression_ratio": 1.7432950191570882, "no_speech_prob": 0.0027104371692985296}, {"id": 46, "seek": 14484, "start": 163.5, "end": 166.04, "text": " The Spirit of the Lord is upon me,", "tokens": [51298, 440, 7218, 295, 264, 3257, 307, 3564, 385, 11, 51425], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19699249267578126, "compression_ratio": 1.7432950191570882, "no_speech_prob": 0.0027104371692985296}, {"id": 47, "seek": 14484, "start": 166.36, "end": 169.36, "text": " because he has anointed me to proclaim good news to the poor.", "tokens": [51441, 570, 415, 575, 364, 33041, 385, 281, 34604, 665, 2583, 281, 264, 4716, 13, 51591], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19699249267578126, "compression_ratio": 1.7432950191570882, "no_speech_prob": 0.0027104371692985296}, {"id": 48, "seek": 14484, "start": 170.02, "end": 173.04, "text": " He has sent me to proclaim liberty to the captives,", "tokens": [51624, 634, 575, 2279, 385, 281, 34604, 22849, 281, 264, 3770, 1539, 11, 51775], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19699249267578126, "compression_ratio": 1.7432950191570882, "no_speech_prob": 0.0027104371692985296}, {"id": 49, "seek": 14484, "start": 173.38, "end": 174.82, "text": " and recovering of sight to the blind,", "tokens": [51792, 293, 29180, 295, 7860, 281, 264, 6865, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19699249267578126, "compression_ratio": 1.7432950191570882, "no_speech_prob": 0.0027104371692985296}, {"id": 50, "seek": 17484, "start": 175.1, "end": 177.74, "text": " to set at liberty those who are oppressed,", "tokens": [50378, 281, 992, 412, 22849, 729, 567, 366, 39640, 11, 50510], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2580144958496094, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.001850578119046986}, {"id": 51, "seek": 17484, "start": 177.74, "end": 180.74, "text": " to proclaim the year of the Lord's favor.", "tokens": [50510, 281, 34604, 264, 1064, 295, 264, 3257, 311, 2294, 13, 50660], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2580144958496094, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.001850578119046986}, {"id": 52, "seek": 17484, "start": 181.74, "end": 182.86, "text": " And he rolled up the scroll,", "tokens": [50710, 400, 415, 14306, 493, 264, 11369, 11, 50766], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2580144958496094, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.001850578119046986}, {"id": 53, "seek": 17484, "start": 183.0, "end": 185.3, "text": " and gave it back to the attendant, and sat down.", "tokens": [50773, 293, 2729, 309, 646, 281, 264, 39339, 11, 293, 3227, 760, 13, 50888], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2580144958496094, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.001850578119046986}, {"id": 54, "seek": 17484, "start": 185.94, "end": 189.06, "text": " And the eyes of all in the synagogue were fixed on him.", "tokens": [50920, 400, 264, 2575, 295, 439, 294, 264, 49169, 645, 6806, 322, 796, 13, 51076], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2580144958496094, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.001850578119046986}, {"id": 55, "seek": 17484, "start": 189.56, "end": 191.2, "text": " And he began to say to them,", "tokens": [51101, 400, 415, 4283, 281, 584, 281, 552, 11, 51183], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2580144958496094, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.001850578119046986}, {"id": 56, "seek": 17484, "start": 191.84, "end": 195.52, "text": " Today this scripture has been fulfilled in your hearing.", "tokens": [51215, 2692, 341, 24783, 575, 668, 21380, 294, 428, 4763, 13, 51399], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2580144958496094, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.001850578119046986}, {"id": 57, "seek": 17484, "start": 196.22, "end": 198.08, "text": " And all spoke well of him,", "tokens": [51434, 400, 439, 7179, 731, 295, 796, 11, 51527], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2580144958496094, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.001850578119046986}, {"id": 58, "seek": 17484, "start": 198.28, "end": 202.06, "text": " and marveled at the gracious words that were coming from his mouth.", "tokens": [51537, 293, 23893, 292, 412, 264, 36113, 2283, 300, 645, 1348, 490, 702, 4525, 13, 51726], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2580144958496094, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.001850578119046986}, {"id": 59, "seek": 17484, "start": 202.62, "end": 203.56, "text": " And they said,", "tokens": [51754, 400, 436, 848, 11, 51801], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2580144958496094, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.001850578119046986}, {"id": 60, "seek": 17484, "start": 203.9, "end": 204.62, "text": " Is not the Lord your God?", "tokens": [51818, 1119, 406, 264, 3257, 428, 1265, 30, 51854], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2580144958496094, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.001850578119046986}, {"id": 61, "seek": 20462, "start": 204.62, "end": 205.98000000000002, "text": " Is not this Joseph's son?", "tokens": [50365, 1119, 406, 341, 11170, 311, 1872, 30, 50433], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16622111745124316, "compression_ratio": 1.5921985815602837, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007207602611742914}, {"id": 62, "seek": 20462, "start": 206.70000000000002, "end": 207.64000000000001, "text": " And he said to them,", "tokens": [50469, 400, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 50516], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16622111745124316, "compression_ratio": 1.5921985815602837, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007207602611742914}, {"id": 63, "seek": 20462, "start": 208.18, "end": 210.20000000000002, "text": " Doubtless you will quote to me this proverb,", "tokens": [50543, 13200, 4517, 1832, 291, 486, 6513, 281, 385, 341, 49923, 11, 50644], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16622111745124316, "compression_ratio": 1.5921985815602837, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007207602611742914}, {"id": 64, "seek": 20462, "start": 210.70000000000002, "end": 212.06, "text": " Physician, heal yourself.", "tokens": [50669, 15542, 9027, 11, 10526, 1803, 13, 50737], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16622111745124316, "compression_ratio": 1.5921985815602837, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007207602611742914}, {"id": 65, "seek": 20462, "start": 213.0, "end": 215.24, "text": " What we have heard you did at Capernaum,", "tokens": [50784, 708, 321, 362, 2198, 291, 630, 412, 383, 2332, 629, 449, 11, 50896], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16622111745124316, "compression_ratio": 1.5921985815602837, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007207602611742914}, {"id": 66, "seek": 20462, "start": 215.70000000000002, "end": 217.48000000000002, "text": " do here in your hometown as well.", "tokens": [50919, 360, 510, 294, 428, 22112, 382, 731, 13, 51008], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16622111745124316, "compression_ratio": 1.5921985815602837, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007207602611742914}, {"id": 67, "seek": 20462, "start": 218.18, "end": 218.96, "text": " And he said,", "tokens": [51043, 400, 415, 848, 11, 51082], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16622111745124316, "compression_ratio": 1.5921985815602837, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007207602611742914}, {"id": 68, "seek": 20462, "start": 219.68, "end": 221.12, "text": " Truly I say to you,", "tokens": [51118, 43548, 286, 584, 281, 291, 11, 51190], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16622111745124316, "compression_ratio": 1.5921985815602837, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007207602611742914}, {"id": 69, "seek": 20462, "start": 221.42000000000002, "end": 223.72, "text": " no prophet is acceptable in his hometown.", "tokens": [51205, 572, 18566, 307, 15513, 294, 702, 22112, 13, 51320], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16622111745124316, "compression_ratio": 1.5921985815602837, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007207602611742914}, {"id": 70, "seek": 20462, "start": 224.32, "end": 225.84, "text": " But in truth I tell you,", "tokens": [51350, 583, 294, 3494, 286, 980, 291, 11, 51426], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16622111745124316, "compression_ratio": 1.5921985815602837, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007207602611742914}, {"id": 71, "seek": 20462, "start": 226.14000000000001, "end": 228.82, "text": " there were many widows in Israel in the days of Elijah,", "tokens": [51441, 456, 645, 867, 5274, 1509, 294, 5674, 294, 264, 1708, 295, 36147, 11, 51575], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16622111745124316, "compression_ratio": 1.5921985815602837, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007207602611742914}, {"id": 72, "seek": 20462, "start": 229.20000000000002, "end": 232.16, "text": " when the heavens were shut up three years and six months,", "tokens": [51594, 562, 264, 26011, 645, 5309, 493, 1045, 924, 293, 2309, 2493, 11, 51742], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16622111745124316, "compression_ratio": 1.5921985815602837, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007207602611742914}, {"id": 73, "seek": 20462, "start": 232.16, "end": 234.6, "text": " and a great famine came over all the land,", "tokens": [51742, 293, 257, 869, 42790, 1361, 670, 439, 264, 2117, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16622111745124316, "compression_ratio": 1.5921985815602837, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007207602611742914}, {"id": 74, "seek": 23462, "start": 235.14000000000001, "end": 237.32, "text": " and Elijah was sent to none of them,", "tokens": [50391, 293, 36147, 390, 2279, 281, 6022, 295, 552, 11, 50500], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1668511248649435, "compression_ratio": 1.7545787545787546, "no_speech_prob": 0.004004962742328644}, {"id": 75, "seek": 23462, "start": 237.62, "end": 240.42000000000002, "text": " but only to Zarephath, in the land of Sidon,", "tokens": [50515, 457, 787, 281, 1176, 543, 950, 998, 11, 294, 264, 2117, 295, 19797, 266, 11, 50655], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1668511248649435, "compression_ratio": 1.7545787545787546, "no_speech_prob": 0.004004962742328644}, {"id": 76, "seek": 23462, "start": 240.76, "end": 242.04, "text": " to a woman who was a widow.", "tokens": [50672, 281, 257, 3059, 567, 390, 257, 37207, 13, 50736], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1668511248649435, "compression_ratio": 1.7545787545787546, "no_speech_prob": 0.004004962742328644}, {"id": 77, "seek": 23462, "start": 242.70000000000002, "end": 246.68, "text": " And there were many lepers in Israel in the time of the prophet Elisha,", "tokens": [50769, 400, 456, 645, 867, 476, 21819, 294, 5674, 294, 264, 565, 295, 264, 18566, 462, 1933, 64, 11, 50968], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1668511248649435, "compression_ratio": 1.7545787545787546, "no_speech_prob": 0.004004962742328644}, {"id": 78, "seek": 23462, "start": 246.96, "end": 248.72, "text": " and none of them was cleansed,", "tokens": [50982, 293, 6022, 295, 552, 390, 16912, 292, 11, 51070], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1668511248649435, "compression_ratio": 1.7545787545787546, "no_speech_prob": 0.004004962742328644}, {"id": 79, "seek": 23462, "start": 248.98000000000002, "end": 250.58, "text": " but only Naaman the Syrian.", "tokens": [51083, 457, 787, 6056, 6147, 264, 24081, 13, 51163], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1668511248649435, "compression_ratio": 1.7545787545787546, "no_speech_prob": 0.004004962742328644}, {"id": 80, "seek": 23462, "start": 251.38, "end": 252.92000000000002, "text": " When they heard these things,", "tokens": [51203, 1133, 436, 2198, 613, 721, 11, 51280], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1668511248649435, "compression_ratio": 1.7545787545787546, "no_speech_prob": 0.004004962742328644}, {"id": 81, "seek": 23462, "start": 253.24, "end": 255.6, "text": " all in the synagogue were filled with wrath.", "tokens": [51296, 439, 294, 264, 49169, 645, 6412, 365, 35496, 13, 51414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1668511248649435, "compression_ratio": 1.7545787545787546, "no_speech_prob": 0.004004962742328644}, {"id": 82, "seek": 23462, "start": 256.06, "end": 258.48, "text": " And they rose up and drove him out of the town,", "tokens": [51437, 400, 436, 10895, 493, 293, 13226, 796, 484, 295, 264, 3954, 11, 51558], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1668511248649435, "compression_ratio": 1.7545787545787546, "no_speech_prob": 0.004004962742328644}, {"id": 83, "seek": 23462, "start": 258.7, "end": 261.84000000000003, "text": " and brought him to the brow of the hill on which their town was built,", "tokens": [51569, 293, 3038, 796, 281, 264, 19299, 295, 264, 10997, 322, 597, 641, 3954, 390, 3094, 11, 51726], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1668511248649435, "compression_ratio": 1.7545787545787546, "no_speech_prob": 0.004004962742328644}, {"id": 84, "seek": 23462, "start": 262.24, "end": 264.54, "text": " so that they could throw him down the cliff.", "tokens": [51746, 370, 300, 436, 727, 3507, 796, 760, 264, 22316, 13, 51861], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1668511248649435, "compression_ratio": 1.7545787545787546, "no_speech_prob": 0.004004962742328644}, {"id": 85, "seek": 26462, "start": 265.14, "end": 266.86, "text": " But passing through their midst,", "tokens": [50391, 583, 8437, 807, 641, 18629, 11, 50477], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2209287591882654, "compression_ratio": 1.6244343891402715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005072097992524505}, {"id": 86, "seek": 26462, "start": 267.38, "end": 268.14, "text": " he went away.", "tokens": [50503, 415, 1437, 1314, 13, 50541], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2209287591882654, "compression_ratio": 1.6244343891402715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005072097992524505}, {"id": 87, "seek": 26462, "start": 269.86, "end": 272.7, "text": " And he went down to Capernaum, a city of Galilee,", "tokens": [50627, 400, 415, 1437, 760, 281, 383, 2332, 629, 449, 11, 257, 2307, 295, 7336, 33914, 11, 50769], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2209287591882654, "compression_ratio": 1.6244343891402715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005072097992524505}, {"id": 88, "seek": 26462, "start": 273.08, "end": 275.18, "text": " and he was teaching them on the Sabbath.", "tokens": [50788, 293, 415, 390, 4571, 552, 322, 264, 36618, 13, 50893], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2209287591882654, "compression_ratio": 1.6244343891402715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005072097992524505}, {"id": 89, "seek": 26462, "start": 275.52, "end": 277.36, "text": " And they were astonished at his teaching,", "tokens": [50910, 400, 436, 645, 25687, 4729, 412, 702, 4571, 11, 51002], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2209287591882654, "compression_ratio": 1.6244343891402715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005072097992524505}, {"id": 90, "seek": 26462, "start": 277.72, "end": 279.88, "text": " for his word possessed authority.", "tokens": [51020, 337, 702, 1349, 29608, 8281, 13, 51128], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2209287591882654, "compression_ratio": 1.6244343891402715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005072097992524505}, {"id": 91, "seek": 26462, "start": 280.62, "end": 283.02, "text": " And in the synagogue there was a man", "tokens": [51165, 400, 294, 264, 49169, 456, 390, 257, 587, 51285], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2209287591882654, "compression_ratio": 1.6244343891402715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005072097992524505}, {"id": 92, "seek": 26462, "start": 283.02, "end": 285.18, "text": " who had the spirit of an unclean demon,", "tokens": [51285, 567, 632, 264, 3797, 295, 364, 9153, 282, 14283, 11, 51393], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2209287591882654, "compression_ratio": 1.6244343891402715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005072097992524505}, {"id": 93, "seek": 26462, "start": 285.58, "end": 287.64, "text": " and he cried out with a loud voice,", "tokens": [51413, 293, 415, 16266, 484, 365, 257, 6588, 3177, 11, 51516], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2209287591882654, "compression_ratio": 1.6244343891402715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005072097992524505}, {"id": 94, "seek": 26462, "start": 288.5, "end": 289.02, "text": " Ha!", "tokens": [51559, 4064, 0, 51585], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2209287591882654, "compression_ratio": 1.6244343891402715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005072097992524505}, {"id": 95, "seek": 26462, "start": 290.56, "end": 293.68, "text": " What have you to do with us,", "tokens": [51662, 708, 362, 291, 281, 360, 365, 505, 11, 51818], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2209287591882654, "compression_ratio": 1.6244343891402715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005072097992524505}, {"id": 96, "seek": 29368, "start": 293.68, "end": 295.6, "text": " Jesus of Nazareth?", "tokens": [50365, 2705, 295, 11870, 40414, 30, 50461], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25992798019241503, "compression_ratio": 1.489247311827957, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032500780071131885}, {"id": 97, "seek": 29368, "start": 296.18, "end": 301.92, "text": " Have you come to destroy us?", "tokens": [50490, 3560, 291, 808, 281, 5293, 505, 30, 50777], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25992798019241503, "compression_ratio": 1.489247311827957, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032500780071131885}, {"id": 98, "seek": 29368, "start": 302.26, "end": 304.86, "text": " I know who you are,", "tokens": [50794, 286, 458, 567, 291, 366, 11, 50924], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25992798019241503, "compression_ratio": 1.489247311827957, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032500780071131885}, {"id": 99, "seek": 29368, "start": 305.36, "end": 309.32, "text": " the Holy One of God.", "tokens": [50949, 264, 6295, 1485, 295, 1265, 13, 51147], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25992798019241503, "compression_ratio": 1.489247311827957, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032500780071131885}, {"id": 100, "seek": 29368, "start": 310.42, "end": 312.88, "text": " But Jesus rebuked him, saying,", "tokens": [51202, 583, 2705, 12970, 2034, 292, 796, 11, 1566, 11, 51325], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25992798019241503, "compression_ratio": 1.489247311827957, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032500780071131885}, {"id": 101, "seek": 29368, "start": 313.64, "end": 315.72, "text": " Be silent, and come out of him.", "tokens": [51363, 879, 12784, 11, 293, 808, 484, 295, 796, 13, 51467], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25992798019241503, "compression_ratio": 1.489247311827957, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032500780071131885}, {"id": 102, "seek": 29368, "start": 316.28000000000003, "end": 319.02, "text": " And when the demon had thrown him down in their midst,", "tokens": [51495, 400, 562, 264, 14283, 632, 11732, 796, 760, 294, 641, 18629, 11, 51632], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25992798019241503, "compression_ratio": 1.489247311827957, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032500780071131885}, {"id": 103, "seek": 29368, "start": 319.3, "end": 322.14, "text": " he came out of him, having done him no harm.", "tokens": [51646, 415, 1361, 484, 295, 796, 11, 1419, 1096, 796, 572, 6491, 13, 51788], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25992798019241503, "compression_ratio": 1.489247311827957, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032500780071131885}, {"id": 104, "seek": 29368, "start": 322.6, "end": 323.64, "text": " And they were all amazed,", "tokens": [51811, 400, 436, 645, 439, 20507, 11, 51863], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25992798019241503, "compression_ratio": 1.489247311827957, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032500780071131885}, {"id": 105, "seek": 32368, "start": 323.68, "end": 325.86, "text": " and said to one another,", "tokens": [50365, 293, 848, 281, 472, 1071, 11, 50474], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19536979270703864, "compression_ratio": 1.7137254901960783, "no_speech_prob": 0.000671888526994735}, {"id": 106, "seek": 32368, "start": 326.38, "end": 327.62, "text": " What is this word?", "tokens": [50500, 708, 307, 341, 1349, 30, 50562], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19536979270703864, "compression_ratio": 1.7137254901960783, "no_speech_prob": 0.000671888526994735}, {"id": 107, "seek": 32368, "start": 328.40000000000003, "end": 329.84000000000003, "text": " For with authority and power", "tokens": [50601, 1171, 365, 8281, 293, 1347, 50673], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19536979270703864, "compression_ratio": 1.7137254901960783, "no_speech_prob": 0.000671888526994735}, {"id": 108, "seek": 32368, "start": 329.84000000000003, "end": 331.58, "text": " he commands the unclean spirits,", "tokens": [50673, 415, 16901, 264, 9153, 282, 16388, 11, 50760], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19536979270703864, "compression_ratio": 1.7137254901960783, "no_speech_prob": 0.000671888526994735}, {"id": 109, "seek": 32368, "start": 331.72, "end": 332.6, "text": " and they come out.", "tokens": [50767, 293, 436, 808, 484, 13, 50811], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19536979270703864, "compression_ratio": 1.7137254901960783, "no_speech_prob": 0.000671888526994735}, {"id": 110, "seek": 32368, "start": 333.06, "end": 335.7, "text": " And reports about him went out into every place", "tokens": [50834, 400, 7122, 466, 796, 1437, 484, 666, 633, 1081, 50966], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19536979270703864, "compression_ratio": 1.7137254901960783, "no_speech_prob": 0.000671888526994735}, {"id": 111, "seek": 32368, "start": 335.7, "end": 336.94, "text": " in the surrounding region.", "tokens": [50966, 294, 264, 11498, 4458, 13, 51028], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19536979270703864, "compression_ratio": 1.7137254901960783, "no_speech_prob": 0.000671888526994735}, {"id": 112, "seek": 32368, "start": 338.16, "end": 340.3, "text": " And he arose and left the synagogue", "tokens": [51089, 400, 415, 37192, 293, 1411, 264, 49169, 51196], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19536979270703864, "compression_ratio": 1.7137254901960783, "no_speech_prob": 0.000671888526994735}, {"id": 113, "seek": 32368, "start": 340.3, "end": 342.16, "text": " and entered Simon's house.", "tokens": [51196, 293, 9065, 13193, 311, 1782, 13, 51289], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19536979270703864, "compression_ratio": 1.7137254901960783, "no_speech_prob": 0.000671888526994735}, {"id": 114, "seek": 32368, "start": 342.92, "end": 346.1, "text": " Now Simon's mother-in-law was ill with a high fever,", "tokens": [51327, 823, 13193, 311, 2895, 12, 259, 12, 5901, 390, 3171, 365, 257, 1090, 18277, 11, 51486], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19536979270703864, "compression_ratio": 1.7137254901960783, "no_speech_prob": 0.000671888526994735}, {"id": 115, "seek": 32368, "start": 346.4, "end": 348.42, "text": " and they appealed to him on her behalf.", "tokens": [51501, 293, 436, 2363, 5573, 281, 796, 322, 720, 9490, 13, 51602], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19536979270703864, "compression_ratio": 1.7137254901960783, "no_speech_prob": 0.000671888526994735}, {"id": 116, "seek": 32368, "start": 349.0, "end": 351.46000000000004, "text": " And he stood over her and rebuked the fever,", "tokens": [51631, 400, 415, 9371, 670, 720, 293, 12970, 2034, 292, 264, 18277, 11, 51754], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19536979270703864, "compression_ratio": 1.7137254901960783, "no_speech_prob": 0.000671888526994735}, {"id": 117, "seek": 32368, "start": 351.94, "end": 352.74, "text": " and it left her.", "tokens": [51778, 293, 309, 1411, 720, 13, 51818], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19536979270703864, "compression_ratio": 1.7137254901960783, "no_speech_prob": 0.000671888526994735}, {"id": 118, "seek": 32368, "start": 353.2, "end": 353.66, "text": " And he said to her,", "tokens": [51841, 400, 415, 848, 281, 720, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19536979270703864, "compression_ratio": 1.7137254901960783, "no_speech_prob": 0.000671888526994735}, {"id": 119, "seek": 35368, "start": 353.68, "end": 356.52, "text": " And immediately she rose and began to serve them.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 4258, 750, 10895, 293, 4283, 281, 4596, 552, 13, 50507], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19759436311392947, "compression_ratio": 1.6341463414634145, "no_speech_prob": 0.002216569148004055}, {"id": 120, "seek": 35368, "start": 357.8, "end": 359.06, "text": " Now when the sun was setting,", "tokens": [50571, 823, 562, 264, 3295, 390, 3287, 11, 50634], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19759436311392947, "compression_ratio": 1.6341463414634145, "no_speech_prob": 0.002216569148004055}, {"id": 121, "seek": 35368, "start": 359.68, "end": 361.68, "text": " all those who had any who were sick", "tokens": [50665, 439, 729, 567, 632, 604, 567, 645, 4998, 50765], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19759436311392947, "compression_ratio": 1.6341463414634145, "no_speech_prob": 0.002216569148004055}, {"id": 122, "seek": 35368, "start": 361.68, "end": 363.92, "text": " with various diseases brought them to him.", "tokens": [50765, 365, 3683, 11044, 3038, 552, 281, 796, 13, 50877], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19759436311392947, "compression_ratio": 1.6341463414634145, "no_speech_prob": 0.002216569148004055}, {"id": 123, "seek": 35368, "start": 364.32, "end": 366.94, "text": " And he laid his hands on every one of them", "tokens": [50897, 400, 415, 9897, 702, 2377, 322, 633, 472, 295, 552, 51028], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19759436311392947, "compression_ratio": 1.6341463414634145, "no_speech_prob": 0.002216569148004055}, {"id": 124, "seek": 35368, "start": 366.94, "end": 367.74, "text": " and healed them.", "tokens": [51028, 293, 20482, 552, 13, 51068], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19759436311392947, "compression_ratio": 1.6341463414634145, "no_speech_prob": 0.002216569148004055}, {"id": 125, "seek": 35368, "start": 368.36, "end": 371.28000000000003, "text": " And demons also came out of many, crying,", "tokens": [51099, 400, 19733, 611, 1361, 484, 295, 867, 11, 8554, 11, 51245], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19759436311392947, "compression_ratio": 1.6341463414634145, "no_speech_prob": 0.002216569148004055}, {"id": 126, "seek": 35368, "start": 372.2, "end": 374.6, "text": " You are the Son of God!", "tokens": [51291, 509, 366, 264, 5185, 295, 1265, 0, 51411], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19759436311392947, "compression_ratio": 1.6341463414634145, "no_speech_prob": 0.002216569148004055}, {"id": 127, "seek": 35368, "start": 375.84000000000003, "end": 378.86, "text": " But he rebuked them and would not allow them to speak,", "tokens": [51473, 583, 415, 12970, 2034, 292, 552, 293, 576, 406, 2089, 552, 281, 1710, 11, 51624], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19759436311392947, "compression_ratio": 1.6341463414634145, "no_speech_prob": 0.002216569148004055}, {"id": 128, "seek": 35368, "start": 379.18, "end": 381.56, "text": " because they knew that he was the Christ.", "tokens": [51640, 570, 436, 2586, 300, 415, 390, 264, 2040, 13, 51759], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19759436311392947, "compression_ratio": 1.6341463414634145, "no_speech_prob": 0.002216569148004055}, {"id": 129, "seek": 35368, "start": 381.56, "end": 383.54, "text": " And when it was day,", "tokens": [51759, 400, 562, 309, 390, 786, 11, 51858], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19759436311392947, "compression_ratio": 1.6341463414634145, "no_speech_prob": 0.002216569148004055}, {"id": 130, "seek": 38368, "start": 383.68, "end": 386.44, "text": " he departed and went into a desolate place.", "tokens": [50365, 415, 47018, 293, 1437, 666, 257, 730, 48278, 1081, 13, 50503], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15042923308990813, "compression_ratio": 1.5816326530612246, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012157214805483818}, {"id": 131, "seek": 38368, "start": 387.0, "end": 389.2, "text": " And the people sought him and came to him,", "tokens": [50531, 400, 264, 561, 17532, 796, 293, 1361, 281, 796, 11, 50641], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15042923308990813, "compression_ratio": 1.5816326530612246, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012157214805483818}, {"id": 132, "seek": 38368, "start": 389.52, "end": 391.74, "text": " and would have kept him from leaving them.", "tokens": [50657, 293, 576, 362, 4305, 796, 490, 5012, 552, 13, 50768], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15042923308990813, "compression_ratio": 1.5816326530612246, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012157214805483818}, {"id": 133, "seek": 38368, "start": 392.34000000000003, "end": 393.3, "text": " But he said to them,", "tokens": [50798, 583, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 50846], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15042923308990813, "compression_ratio": 1.5816326530612246, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012157214805483818}, {"id": 134, "seek": 38368, "start": 393.74, "end": 396.66, "text": " I must preach the good news of the kingdom of God", "tokens": [50868, 286, 1633, 21552, 264, 665, 2583, 295, 264, 10231, 295, 1265, 51014], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15042923308990813, "compression_ratio": 1.5816326530612246, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012157214805483818}, {"id": 135, "seek": 38368, "start": 396.66, "end": 398.2, "text": " to the other towns as well,", "tokens": [51014, 281, 264, 661, 18104, 382, 731, 11, 51091], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15042923308990813, "compression_ratio": 1.5816326530612246, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012157214805483818}, {"id": 136, "seek": 38368, "start": 398.66, "end": 400.38, "text": " for I was sent for this purpose.", "tokens": [51114, 337, 286, 390, 2279, 337, 341, 4334, 13, 51200], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15042923308990813, "compression_ratio": 1.5816326530612246, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012157214805483818}, {"id": 137, "seek": 38368, "start": 401.18, "end": 403.92, "text": " And he was preaching in the synagogues of Judea.", "tokens": [51240, 400, 415, 390, 25381, 294, 264, 5451, 31599, 1247, 295, 36521, 64, 13, 51377], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15042923308990813, "compression_ratio": 1.5816326530612246, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012157214805483818}], "language": "English"}